notifications.danger:
This product poses a risk of injuries because:



- brake discs in the control circuit are not securely attached; 



- plastic parts on surfaces, edges and corners can easily break;



- there is no full protection of moving parts as chain and sprocket; 



and a risk of burns because the end of the exhaust pipe can reach a temperature in excess of 70°C.



In addition, instructions are incomplete and incorrectly translated.



This product does not comply with the Machinery Directive.

